      "content": "it's not even that i'm sad, really. sadness would at least be a feeling. it's just this... constant, heavy nothingness. it's like i'm watching my own life happen from behind a thick sheet of glass. i try to force myself to feel something, anything, but it's just gone. i'm just exhausted from pretending to be a person.",
